# error: 19:7: `from_text` is built into every plain enum
# error: 28:11: `.text` is the name of a plain enum's variant; `Shape` has variants with payloads
# error: 28:23: `from_text` gives a plain enum's variant by its name; `Shape` has variants with payloads, which a name cannot build
# error: 30:5: cannot assign to `.text`; a variant's name is read-only
# error: 31:11: no method `text` on type `Mode`; a variant's name is a member, read without a call: `m.text`
# error: 31:24: `Mode.from_text(word)` takes its argument by position
# error: 31:52: `Mode.from_text(word)` takes one argument, a `?String`; got 2
# error: 31:88: type mismatch: expected `?String`, got `Int`
# error: 33:7: `m.text` is a variant's name, a `Static`, not a part of the value to lend; pass it as it is: `m.text`
